    "notes": "54 tasks \u00d7 3 attempts = 162 trials. 7 categories (X-ray Report Correction, CT Abnormality Classification, Pathology Tumor Area, Clinical Trial Matching, EHR Data Quality Audit, EHR Event Modelling, EHR Format Conversion) \u00d7 5 modalities. Metric = binary task success rate. **Codex GPT-5.5 = 42% overall #1**. Buried findings: GPT-5.4 beats GPT-5.5 on X-ray Report Correction (40 vs 33), Claude Opus 4.6 leads EHR Data Quality Audit (42), Opus 4.7 leads EHR Event Modelling (78 vs GPT-5.5 72), Opus 4.6 uniquely fails MEDS Format Conversion (0% while all others 100), Opus 4.6 fails 3D CT (0%). Harness matters: GPT-5.5 42\u219235 (Codex\u2192Copilot), Opus-4.8 32\u219236 (Claude Code\u2192Copilot). No new models introduced. Dedupe: took MAX per (model, bench) \u2014 66 \u2192 64 scores."
  },
